<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">IMPORT / 01</view>
  <view class="title">把通知丢进来，<br/>剩下的交给我们。</view>
  <view class="muted intro">文字、截图或 PDF 都可以。我们会把它编译成你的行动。</view>
  <view class="input-tabs"><view class="input-tab active">粘贴文字</view><view class="input-tab">截图</view><view class="input-tab">PDF</view><view class="input-tab disabled">录音</view></view>
  <textarea class="notice-input" value="{{text}}" placeholder="在这里粘贴校园通知原文" maxlength="100000" bindinput="onInput" />
  <view class="source-hint" wx:if="{{scenarioLabel}}"><text class="tag blue">示例通知</text> {{scenarioLabel}}</view>
  <button class="button secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="chooseFile">＋ 选择截图 / PDF 文件</button>
  <view class="muted file-name" wx:if="{{fileName}}">已选择：{{fileName}}</view>
  <view class="card muted">录音导入：当前真实 API 尚未提供小程序音频上传与 ASR 入口，暂不可用。</view>
  <view class="sample-title" wx:if="{{demoMode}}">或者，直接试试示例通知</view>
  <view class="sample-row" wx:if="{{demoMode}}">
    <view class="sample-chip" bindtap="loadScenario" data-scenario="student">学籍核验</view>
    <view class="sample-chip" bindtap="loadScenario" data-scenario="scholarship">奖学金</view>
    <view class="sample-chip" bindtap="loadScenario" data-scenario="extension">延期通知</view>
    <view class="sample-chip" bindtap="loadScenario" data-scenario="orchestration">行动编排</view>
  </view>
  <button class="button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="submit">开始编译行动 →</button>
  <view class="danger" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{canManual}}">
    <view class="title">解析失败后的人工建任务</view>
    <view class="muted">原文和文件仍保留在当前文档中。只有你点击确认后，才会落库为人工任务。</view>
    <input value="{{manualTitle}}" placeholder="任务标题" maxlength="500" bindinput="onManualTitle" />
    <input value="{{manualDueAt}}" placeholder="截止时间（可选，如 2099-10-04T12:00:00+08:00）" bindinput="onManualDueAt" />
    <button class="button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="manualCreate">确认创建人工任务</button>
  </view>
</view>
